  "releaseNotes": "4.0.1: Opening accepts LumDBS page formats up to 1.3.9, so older files such as 1.3.2 open again. Formats newer than 1.3.9, and any version listed in the unsupported-version list, are still rejected. New files are still written as 1.3.9. 4.0.0: Major bump for the removed public DbEngine.ReadWriteLock plus the new transaction/file contracts. A failed statement aborts the transaction (TransactionAborted; Discard to reuse); a failed commit keeps dirty pages for retry; cross-thread Dispose is safe; new readers see the latest commit; empty commits no longer create the .log; a failed log replay keeps it. Pool cap 32 with TooManyOpenTransactions and TransactionPoolWaitMilliseconds. Serializable transactions throw NotSupportedException.",
